1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,494
听：Explore MKII.

2
00:00:02,494 --> 00:00:04,988
跟读：Explore MKII.

3
00:00:04,988 --> 00:00:32,819
听：MKII, a planet billions of kilometers away, is the origin of life in many religions. Physicists have proved the theory that its gentle climate and the pull of its gravity are similar to the earth’s. And astronomers have found that oxygen atoms and carbon dioxide, which are fundamental to life, exist in its atmosphere through satellites.

4
00:00:32,819 --> 00:01:00,649
跟读：MKII, a planet billions of kilometers away, is the origin of life in many religions. Physicists have proved the theory that its gentle climate and the pull of its gravity are similar to the earth’s. And astronomers have found that oxygen atoms and carbon dioxide, which are fundamental to life, exist in its atmosphere through satellites.

5
00:01:00,649 --> 00:01:23,991
听：Cheered up by this news, biologists, in their turn, began to do some research to remove people’s puzzles — Now that there are some suitable conditions, does life really exist on this globe? Do they multiply by laying eggs or giving birth to babies? Last month, a spaceship was sent there.

6
00:01:23,991 --> 00:01:47,332
跟读：Cheered up by this news, biologists, in their turn, began to do some research to remove people’s puzzles — Now that there are some suitable conditions, does life really exist on this globe? Do they multiply by laying eggs or giving birth to babies? Last month, a spaceship was sent there.

7
00:01:47,332 --> 00:02:03,824
听：It’s a pity that this mission failed. Unlike the earth, MKII is a much younger planet. Thus, masses of harmful acid clouds float everywhere causing violent chain reactions to break out.

8
00:02:03,824 --> 00:02:20,317
跟读：It’s a pity that this mission failed. Unlike the earth, MKII is a much younger planet. Thus, masses of harmful acid clouds float everywhere causing violent chain reactions to break out.

9
00:02:20,317 --> 00:02:34,180
听：These clouds not only blocked out the pilots’ sight but also damaged the engine system. Luckily, the pilots watched out carefully and prevented the spaceship from crashing in time.

10
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:48,044
跟读：These clouds not only blocked out the pilots’ sight but also damaged the engine system. Luckily, the pilots watched out carefully and prevented the spaceship from crashing in time.
